38344>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
38347>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
38348>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
38349>>>
